OL,3,GNEWSA'Pothole' emerges at new #12m bus
OL,4,Astation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "pothole" has appeared at a new bus
OL,7,Fstation three months after the #12m
OL,8,Ffacility opened.
OL,10,FBishop Auckland bus station on Saddler
OL,11,FStreet took more than two years to
OL,12,Fbuild and opened in May following
OL,13,Fdelays.
OL,15,FLabour MP Sam Rushworth said "serious
OL,16,Fquestions" had to be asked about how
OL,17,Fthe project had been delivered if a
OL,18,F"pothole" had already appeared.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
