OL,3,GNEWSA'Pothole' emerges at new #12m bus
OL,4,Astation
OL,5,
OL,6,FRachael Smith, manager for transport
OL,7,Fand infrastructure, at Reform UK-run
OL,8,FDurham County Council said they were
OL,9,Faware of the defect and investigations
OL,10,Fwere taking place to find the source of
OL,11,Fthe fault.
